WEBVTT

00:00:02.290 --> 00:00:04.790
What are you doing here, Grand Magus?!

00:00:04.790 --> 00:00:06.750
We'll talk later.

00:00:06.750 --> 00:00:08.000
<i>Fire Storm</i>!

00:00:12.050 --> 00:00:14.340
I'll clear a path!

00:00:14.340 --> 00:00:15.300
Retreat!

00:02:02.120 --> 00:02:04.120
Yes! It looks like it worked!

00:02:04.120 --> 00:02:07.960
Let's move on to bigger things, then, yes?

00:02:07.960 --> 00:02:10.130
You're sure it's all right?

00:02:10.130 --> 00:02:13.840
Yes, I received permission
from Lord Klausner himself.

00:02:13.840 --> 00:02:15.420
Right then, let's get started.

00:02:15.420 --> 00:02:16.420
Yes, ma'am!

00:02:30.100 --> 00:02:32.560
Did you just cast the Saint's conjury?

00:02:32.560 --> 00:02:34.860
G-Good morning, Ser!

00:02:34.860 --> 00:02:36.820
That <i>was </i>the Saint's conjury, wasn't it?!

00:02:36.820 --> 00:02:39.450
I see you've learned how
to cast it at will!

00:02:39.450 --> 00:02:42.160
But why are you casting it here and now?

00:02:42.160 --> 00:02:44.830
And why haven't you cast it for <i>me </i>yet?

00:02:44.830 --> 00:02:47.450
Do you hate me? Are you punishing me?

00:02:47.450 --> 00:02:48.960
Oh, no, I just...

00:02:48.960 --> 00:02:53.790
I asked her for a place to practice
casting it, and she took me here.

00:02:53.790 --> 00:02:55.300
Is that so?

00:02:55.300 --> 00:02:59.840
This small plot was only just prepared
for us, so nothing’s been planted yet.

00:02:59.840 --> 00:03:03.640
We wanted to make sure the Saint's
conjury wouldn't harm the plants.

00:03:03.640 --> 00:03:05.890
I see.

00:03:05.890 --> 00:03:10.980
I don't believe it would cause any harm,
but it may affect the soil.

00:03:10.980 --> 00:03:11.980
Huh?

00:03:13.610 --> 00:03:15.980
I sense a peculiar magical aura.

00:03:15.980 --> 00:03:18.190
What do you think it's done to the soil?

00:03:19.860 --> 00:03:21.160
I'm unsure.

00:03:21.160 --> 00:03:23.740
The magic power may have
flowed directly into the soil,

00:03:23.740 --> 00:03:26.950
or it may have imbued the minerals
within the soil with magic power.

00:03:26.950 --> 00:03:29.580
Both seem probable.

00:03:29.580 --> 00:03:32.790
Those are just my hypotheses, of course.

00:03:32.790 --> 00:03:36.210
We'll need to perform a few
tests to confirm them.

00:03:36.210 --> 00:03:38.840
Indeed.

00:03:38.840 --> 00:03:41.590
Well, aren't <i>they </i>two peas in a pod...

00:03:41.590 --> 00:03:44.090
Shall we move on to the next one?

00:03:44.090 --> 00:03:46.100
Yes, let's.

00:03:46.100 --> 00:03:47.100
Huh?

00:03:53.020 --> 00:03:54.650
Try these.

00:03:54.650 --> 00:03:55.810
Wait...

00:03:55.810 --> 00:03:57.070
What?

00:03:57.070 --> 00:03:59.110
What?!

00:04:06.950 --> 00:04:11.790
It would seem the Saint's conjury
expends quite a bit of your magic power.

00:04:11.790 --> 00:04:14.500
Y-Yes, it does. Yep.

00:04:14.500 --> 00:04:19.760
You can see how <i>tired </i>I am after
you made me cast it over and over...

00:04:19.760 --> 00:04:22.380
Repetition is the key to mastery.

00:04:22.380 --> 00:04:27.550
With more training, you should
be able to cast it even faster.

00:04:27.550 --> 00:04:30.390
What?! Even faster than
I'm casting it now?!

00:04:30.390 --> 00:04:33.600
I mean, hold on, I don't know if I can...

00:04:33.600 --> 00:04:37.110
I have to prep myself before
I can even cast it...

00:04:37.110 --> 00:04:39.230
You <i>do</i>?

00:04:39.230 --> 00:04:43.360
What kind of preparation do you
have to do to successfully cast it?

00:04:43.360 --> 00:04:48.580
Huh? Um...

00:04:48.580 --> 00:04:50.040
Is it difficult to put into words?

00:04:52.160 --> 00:04:54.580
I see. That's all right.

00:04:54.580 --> 00:04:56.420
Wait, really?

00:04:56.420 --> 00:04:59.460
Unless you'd like to tell me?

00:04:59.460 --> 00:05:00.460
No...

00:05:02.590 --> 00:05:03.590
Come in.

00:05:05.930 --> 00:05:06.930
Sei!

00:05:06.930 --> 00:05:09.140
Commander Hawke!

00:05:09.140 --> 00:05:12.100
My apologies, I was told you were here...

00:05:12.100 --> 00:05:15.770
Please, come in. What is it you need?

00:05:15.770 --> 00:05:18.560
We've completed our plans
for resuming our failed expedition.

00:05:18.560 --> 00:05:20.520
Please, have a look.

00:05:20.520 --> 00:05:22.280
I'd like for you to accompany
us again, Sei.

00:05:24.400 --> 00:05:27.490
I see no problems with your proposed plan.

00:05:27.490 --> 00:05:29.780
Thank you.

00:05:29.780 --> 00:05:32.200
Toxic slimes...

00:05:32.200 --> 00:05:33.750
How <i>thrilling</i>.

00:05:47.180 --> 00:05:49.550
Good morning, Sei!

00:05:49.550 --> 00:05:51.890
Morning, Aira.

00:05:51.890 --> 00:05:54.020
I see we're in the same squadron!

00:05:54.020 --> 00:05:57.350
Yep! Are you going to help fight, too?

00:05:57.350 --> 00:06:00.230
Probably, if they need help...

00:06:00.230 --> 00:06:02.570
But I'm supposed to be on healing duty.

00:06:02.570 --> 00:06:06.780
The other mages told me the Grand Magus
probably won't help with healing.

00:06:06.780 --> 00:06:08.200
Yeah, I doubt it...

00:06:10.240 --> 00:06:12.080
Good morning, Lady Sei!

00:06:12.080 --> 00:06:14.830
G-Good morning.

00:06:14.830 --> 00:06:16.330
Yo!

00:06:16.330 --> 00:06:18.460
Are you going to be in our squad, too?

00:06:18.460 --> 00:06:20.540
You bet! Let's crush it today!

00:06:20.540 --> 00:06:22.290
Good morning, Sei.

00:06:22.290 --> 00:06:24.880
Good morning, Lady Sei!

00:06:24.880 --> 00:06:26.970
Good morning.

00:06:26.970 --> 00:06:29.590
So <i>he's </i>the Inferno Fiend.

00:06:29.590 --> 00:06:31.510
Inferno what?

00:06:31.510 --> 00:06:37.140
He earned that nickname from how he
torches huge swaths of monsters

00:06:37.140 --> 00:06:40.150
to a crisp.

00:06:40.150 --> 00:06:43.400
I hope he restrains himself.

00:06:43.400 --> 00:06:44.360
Huh?

00:06:44.360 --> 00:06:48.530
I just don't want the forest
to go up in flames.

00:06:48.530 --> 00:06:50.490
Yeah.

00:06:50.490 --> 00:06:54.030
I should ask him to try and avoid
burning the whole thing down.

00:06:54.830 --> 00:06:57.830
Return

00:07:05.920 --> 00:07:07.130
<i>Ice Spear</i>!

00:07:10.510 --> 00:07:11.680
<i>Area Protection</i>!

00:07:13.180 --> 00:07:14.300
<i>Fire Lance</i>!

00:07:17.060 --> 00:07:18.060
<i>Heal</i>!

00:07:20.770 --> 00:07:22.560
Thanks, miss.

00:07:22.560 --> 00:07:23.810
Of course!

00:07:23.810 --> 00:07:26.320
Thank you, Your Holiness.

00:07:26.320 --> 00:07:27.820
Don't mention it.

00:07:27.820 --> 00:07:30.070
There seem to be more of them today.

00:07:30.070 --> 00:07:33.030
And more slimes, too.

00:07:33.030 --> 00:07:35.740
We may be quite close
to that miasma swamp.

00:07:35.740 --> 00:07:37.200
Grand Magus!

00:07:37.200 --> 00:07:40.500
Spare the forest, yes, I know.

00:08:07.940 --> 00:08:08.460
They're coming!

00:08:08.460 --> 00:08:09.440
Engage!

00:08:09.440 --> 00:08:10.300
There are too many of them!

00:08:10.300 --> 00:08:11.490
Stay alert, men!

00:08:16.530 --> 00:08:17.740
<i>Fire Lance</i>!

00:08:22.000 --> 00:08:23.250
Hold the line!

00:08:24.370 --> 00:08:26.670
I'm on it!

00:08:26.670 --> 00:08:28.050
<i>Water Wall</i>!

00:08:30.130 --> 00:08:31.380
<i>Ice Arrow</i>!

00:08:36.090 --> 00:08:37.260
<i>Ice Wall</i>!

00:08:39.180 --> 00:08:40.390
<i>Ground Spear</i>!

00:08:46.940 --> 00:08:47.940
Heal!

00:08:48.980 --> 00:08:49.980
Thank you.

00:08:51.900 --> 00:08:52.900
Sei!

00:09:03.330 --> 00:09:05.040
Commander Hawke!

00:09:05.040 --> 00:09:06.830
Not yet! <i>Fire Lance</i>!

00:09:13.550 --> 00:09:14.470
Thank you.

00:09:14.470 --> 00:09:16.220
Of course. Lady Sei, if you will...

00:09:16.220 --> 00:09:18.050
R-Right. <i>Heal</i>.

00:09:20.970 --> 00:09:21.970
Thank you.

00:09:24.390 --> 00:09:26.100
Thank you for your help.

00:09:26.100 --> 00:09:27.560
No need.

00:09:27.560 --> 00:09:31.320
Your conjury uses far too much
of your magic power.

00:09:31.320 --> 00:09:33.570
Try to withhold from using it
until we reach the swamp...

00:09:43.500 --> 00:09:44.500
Oh, dear.

00:10:07.230 --> 00:10:10.770
Lady Sei, can you purify the miasma
swamp from this distance?

00:10:12.820 --> 00:10:15.490
Could we get a little closer?

00:10:15.490 --> 00:10:18.200
Very well. We'll get you there.

00:10:21.240 --> 00:10:25.750
We're too entrenched to retreat now.
We'll just need to fight our way through.

00:10:34.630 --> 00:10:35.960
Let's go.

00:10:37.670 --> 00:10:38.970
<i>Fire Lance</i>!

00:10:41.600 --> 00:10:42.930
With me, men!

00:10:44.930 --> 00:10:46.230
<i>Round Spark</i>!

00:10:56.610 --> 00:10:57.690
Lady Sei!

00:10:58.610 --> 00:10:59.660
<i>Whirlwind</i>!

00:11:02.320 --> 00:11:03.490
Quickly, now!

00:11:03.490 --> 00:11:04.580
On it!

00:11:25.470 --> 00:11:26.470
Commander!

00:11:27.470 --> 00:11:28.640
Commander Hawke!

00:11:28.640 --> 00:11:32.270
We'll handle the slimes!
You handle the miasma!

00:11:36.400 --> 00:11:37.400
Lady Sei!

00:11:38.490 --> 00:11:39.490
Sei!

00:11:51.040 --> 00:11:52.290
<i>Inferno</i>.

00:12:07.600 --> 00:12:10.270
Lady Sei, this is your chance.

00:12:10.270 --> 00:12:11.560
<i>Fire Lance</i>!

00:12:20.280 --> 00:12:22.990
I have to hurry,
I have to hurry, or else...

00:13:42.860 --> 00:13:45.450
What's wrong?

00:13:45.450 --> 00:13:49.450
Nothing, just a bit lost in thought.

00:13:49.450 --> 00:13:52.910
I see. It's been quite the day, after all.

00:13:52.910 --> 00:13:56.830
You must be exhausted. You should lie
down when you get a chance.

00:13:56.830 --> 00:13:59.290
Thank you, Commander.

00:14:04.380 --> 00:14:05.590
Sei?

00:14:05.590 --> 00:14:10.550
Oh, sorry. I think I <i>will </i>lie down,
if that's all right.

00:14:10.550 --> 00:14:12.260
I'll walk you to your tent.

00:14:12.260 --> 00:14:13.640
Thank you.

00:14:13.640 --> 00:14:14.810
Of course.

00:14:22.520 --> 00:14:24.570
Thank you for all your help.

00:14:24.570 --> 00:14:27.910
It's my honor. Please, rest well.

00:14:27.910 --> 00:14:30.490
I will. Good night.

00:14:30.490 --> 00:14:31.620
Good night.

00:14:47.800 --> 00:14:51.090
Is there something on your mind?

00:14:54.640 --> 00:14:58.690
I know it's selfish to want
anything more from him.

00:15:00.350 --> 00:15:04.690
But even still,
I can't let him go like this...

00:15:09.150 --> 00:15:16.830
Sei, as a Knight, I serve my Kingdom.
My sword is pledged to the King himself.

00:15:16.830 --> 00:15:19.870
But if you would allow me the honor,

00:15:19.870 --> 00:15:23.380
then I would also like to pledge
my sword to <i>you</i>.

00:15:23.380 --> 00:15:27.300
Might I grant you your every wish?

00:16:18.020 --> 00:16:19.930
Whatever are you doing?

00:16:19.930 --> 00:16:23.310
U-Uh, you know, something...

00:16:25.020 --> 00:16:28.820
Focus, focus... Try to focus...

00:16:31.900 --> 00:16:32.720
Ser...

00:16:32.720 --> 00:16:34.110
What is it?

00:16:34.110 --> 00:16:38.950
Nothing, just... your stare
is just a <i>bit </i>unnerving.

00:16:38.950 --> 00:16:41.830
My apologies. Please, don't mind me.

00:16:47.420 --> 00:16:49.130
I hope I can do this...

00:17:04.060 --> 00:17:05.650
I know you can do this.

00:17:10.900 --> 00:17:13.360
Oh, how <i>very </i>interesting.

00:17:40.140 --> 00:17:43.430
Please, return the forest
to its former life!

00:18:13.010 --> 00:18:14.840
My word!

00:18:14.840 --> 00:18:17.220
Oh, wow! It's beautiful!

00:18:20.550 --> 00:18:24.180
It's back... Klausner's woods are back!

00:18:41.660 --> 00:18:43.580
Sei? Sei!

00:18:43.580 --> 00:18:44.390
Sei-<i>san</i>!

00:18:44.390 --> 00:18:44.970
Lady Sei!

00:18:44.970 --> 00:18:45.450
Sei!

00:18:56.470 --> 00:18:58.840
Thank goodness, you're awake.

00:18:58.840 --> 00:19:00.720
Wh-Why are you holding me?!

00:19:00.720 --> 00:19:04.850
You lost consciousness.
You must truly have been exhausted.

00:19:04.850 --> 00:19:08.520
Thanks, but I'm all right now! Really!

00:19:08.520 --> 00:19:10.770
This is your punishment
for worrying us so.

00:19:23.780 --> 00:19:25.330
A-Actually...

00:19:30.000 --> 00:19:33.540
I'd like to walk, if that's all right.

00:19:36.050 --> 00:19:37.050
Very well.

00:19:51.940 --> 00:19:56.940
At the very least, would you allow me
the honor of supporting you as you walk?

00:19:59.190 --> 00:20:00.200
Of course!

00:20:10.160 --> 00:20:11.960
Thanks for your help.

00:20:11.960 --> 00:20:15.710
Please, you've done so
much for me. Thank <i>you</i>.

00:20:15.710 --> 00:20:19.920
Fulfilling all those potion orders
is gonna be hectic without you here.

00:20:19.920 --> 00:20:21.430
Yeah, well...

00:20:21.430 --> 00:20:23.260
I know, no helping that.

00:20:23.260 --> 00:20:26.600
Only a monster like you
could craft that many in a day.

00:20:28.020 --> 00:20:33.060
You're just as incredible as
milord Klausner said you'd be.

00:20:34.400 --> 00:20:37.190
Hey! Heading out already?

00:20:37.190 --> 00:20:38.190
That's right.

00:20:38.190 --> 00:20:39.690
Take care out there.

00:20:39.690 --> 00:20:41.700
You too, Leo.

00:20:41.700 --> 00:20:45.160
Sure. And if you start to hate the
capital, you're always welcome here.

00:20:45.160 --> 00:20:50.120
Oh, please! If she comes
back here, she's <i>mine</i>!

00:20:50.120 --> 00:20:52.410
Sei, we should go.

00:20:52.410 --> 00:20:54.170
All right.

00:20:54.170 --> 00:20:57.170
Thank you again for all your help!

00:20:57.170 --> 00:20:58.750
Of course. Come visit anytime.

00:21:03.840 --> 00:21:07.100
The Saint's magic power is incredible.

00:21:07.100 --> 00:21:09.520
She regrew the whole damn forest.

00:21:09.520 --> 00:21:10.890
I'd say.

00:21:10.890 --> 00:21:14.980
But it wasn't just her magic power.

00:21:14.980 --> 00:21:18.690
That incredible power of hers is something
we all possess inside ourselves.

00:21:18.690 --> 00:21:22.070
Wow, Granny, are you finally losing it?

00:21:22.070 --> 00:21:23.150
Ow!

00:21:23.150 --> 00:21:24.740
It's simple, really.

00:21:26.110 --> 00:21:28.990
The Saint's magic power...

00:21:28.990 --> 00:21:30.330
...is love.

00:23:05.260 --> 00:23:08.130
There really is no place like home.

00:23:11.970 --> 00:23:14.350
I'm sure we'll be asked to set out
on another expedition

00:23:14.350 --> 00:23:16.140
in the very near future.

00:23:16.140 --> 00:23:18.690
Yet another burden placed
upon your shoulders, Sei.

00:23:18.690 --> 00:23:20.650
That's all right.

00:23:20.650 --> 00:23:22.110
You're sure?

00:23:22.110 --> 00:23:27.070
Of course. You know what they say about
the Saint, right, Commander Hawke?

00:23:27.070 --> 00:23:28.820
<i>The Saint's Magic Power</i>...
